  "name": "Sociology of the Family",
  "description": "In this course, learners explore how families are integrated within larger social systems how patterns of social power and inequality shape Canadian families as well as how and why the family is critical to the socialization process. The course culminates in the critical assessment of issues affecting families in Canada.",
